.TH DU 1.SH NAMEdu \- disk usage of a directory tree.SH SYNOPSIS\fBdu\fR[\-a] directory.SH DESCRIPTION\fBdu\fRwalks the directory named and every directory beneath it, and prints oneline for each: its bytes, kilobytes, sectors and number of files.  Atotal for the tree comes last..nf    Directory name                      Bytes    kBytes   Sectors    File #    /dd/GAMES/BOG                       84556        83       331         3    Total of 83 kBytes (331 sectors) in 1 directories and 3 files..fi.SH OPTIONS.TP 12\fB\-a\fRonly the final total..SH NOTESNeeds Microware's\fBcio\fR.\fR.SH SEE ALSOdir, free